{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the image encoder with a more advanced model (imagenet_vit_l) in a multiprofile multimodal setup previously using resnet50 (config_018). Validation accuracy improved slightly (0.6287 vs 0.6186), but F1 decreased slightly (0.5993 vs 0.6103), suggesting potential trade-offs. The exact contribution of the image encoder versus other design choices remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

